{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫小花游嘉欣（游游）向來青春活潑，近日她在社交網發布一段影片，挑戰在香港街頭變身辣妹，伴隨歌曲《Te-Te Gyaru》的輕快節奏不停彈跳，帶來耳目一新的感覺。</p><p>片中游游一口氣演繹兩款截然不同的「辣妹風」造型，日間她現身打卡熱點彩虹邨天台籃</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T11:17:48.880113+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:01:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:12.195695+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:12.195695+00:00","content_hash":"82e27f70e32530b03b44ca90d422382b70ff814a608897193eb534834a9446ce","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}